>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Lattice patrols a square around the centre of the arena and fires from
*> its corners. It drives to a corner, stops dead, fires heavy shots at the
*> tracked contact while still, then moves on to the next corner. Being hit
*> at a corner reverses the patrol once that stop's shots are done. The square
*> shrinks with the safe zone in sudden death.
*>
*> Protocol 2, on the COBOL binding: one CY-READ a turn fills CY-GAME and
*> CY-STATE, and each control is its own call. Lattice tracks the nearest
*> robot by its core-tracked slot, and asks the core for a shot solution
*> including muzzle offset, inherited velocity and gravity.
*> It steps out across the storm's path from the storm's centre and
*> velocity.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LATTICE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "clunkyard.cpy".
01 TICK-NUMBER    PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 FLAG-VALUE     PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 MODE-3D        PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 FORCES         PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 GRAVITY-RULE   PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 ZONE-PRESENT   PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 TRACKING       PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 VISIBLE        PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 FIRE-FLAG      PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 HOLDING        PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 STATUS-CODE    PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 PITCH-STEP     PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
*> The patrol: corner 0..3, direction +1 or -1, and whether Lattice is
*> holding at a corner (1) or driving to it (0).
01 CORNER         PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 PATROL-DIR     PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 1.
01 AT-CORNER      PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 HOLD-START     PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 CORNER-SHOTS   PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WAS-HIT        PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 TRACK-VALID    PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 SWEEP-SET      PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

*> hello.arena.combat and the arena, kept for the whole match.
01 POWER-MIN      USAGE COMP-2.
01 POWER-MAX      USAGE COMP-2.
01 SPEED-BASE     USAGE COMP-2.
01 SPEED-PER      USAGE COMP-2.
01 FIRE-BASE      USAGE COMP-2.
01 FIRE-PER       USAGE COMP-2.
01 ENERGY-MAX     USAGE COMP-2.
01 REGEN          USAGE COMP-2.
01 MOVE-COST      USAGE COMP-2.
01 SD-TICK        USAGE COMP-2.
01 ARENA-W        USAGE COMP-2.
01 ARENA-H        USAGE COMP-2.
01 ARENA-D        USAGE COMP-2.
*> Style, set per game in CHOOSE-TUNING.
01 SQUARE-HALF    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 55.
01 PATROL-SPEED   USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 90.
01 HOLD-TICKS     USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 100.
01 SHOTS-PER-STOP USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 3.
01 REACH          USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 620.
01 FIRE-RESERVE        USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.
01 CLOSE-RANGE         USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 160.

*> This tick's state.
01 TIME-NOW       USAGE COMP-2.
01 TICK-VALUE     USAGE COMP-2.
01 SX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 SY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 SZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 SELF-HEADING        USAGE COMP-2.
01 PITCH          USAGE COMP-2.
01 AIM-NOW        USAGE COMP-2.
01 AIM-PITCH-NOW  USAGE COMP-2.
01 HEALTH         USAGE COMP-2.
01 LAST-HEALTH    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE -1.
01 COOLDOWN       USAGE COMP-2.
01 ENERGY         USAGE COMP-2.
01 MVX            USAGE COMP-2.
01 MVY            USAGE COMP-2.
01 MVZ            USAGE COMP-2.
01 MY-SPEED       USAGE COMP-2.
01 GRAVITY-Z      USAGE COMP-2.
01 TERRAIN        USAGE COMP-2.
01 FWD-X          USAGE COMP-2.
01 FWD-Y          USAGE COMP-2.
01 FWD-Z          USAGE COMP-2.
01 RGT-X          USAGE COMP-2.
01 RGT-Y          USAGE COMP-2.
01 RGT-Z          USAGE COMP-2.
01 UP-X           USAGE COMP-2.
01 UP-Y           USAGE COMP-2.
01 UP-Z           USAGE COMP-2.
01 W-YAW          USAGE COMP-2.
01 W-PITCH        USAGE COMP-2.
01 W-ROLL         USAGE COMP-2.
01 ZONE-X         USAGE COMP-2.
01 ZONE-Y         USAGE COMP-2.
01 ZONE-Z         USAGE COMP-2.
01 ZONE-RADIUS    USAGE COMP-2.
*> The moving storm, when it is in the arena; only x and y count.
01 STORM-PRESENT  PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 STORM-X        USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-Y        USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-RADIUS   USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-VX       USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-VY       USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-AX       USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-AY       USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-D        USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-V        USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-PX       USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-PY       USAGE COMP-2.
01 STORM-PUSH     USAGE COMP-2.

*> The track of the nearest contact.
01 ECHO-RANGE     USAGE COMP-2.
01 ECHO-BEARING   USAGE COMP-2.
01 ECHO-ELEV      USAGE COMP-2.
01 TRACK-T        USAGE COMP-2.
01 TRACK-X        USAGE COMP-2.
01 TRACK-Y        USAGE COMP-2.
01 TRACK-Z        USAGE COMP-2.
01 TRACK-VX       USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 TRACK-VY       USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 TRACK-VZ       USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 PX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 PY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 PZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 QX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 QY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 QZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 RX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 RY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 RZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 DIST           USAGE COMP-2.
01 FLAT           USAGE COMP-2.
01 AGE            USAGE COMP-2.
01 TARGET-SPEED   USAGE COMP-2.
01 ALONG          USAGE COMP-2.
01 CROSSING       USAGE COMP-2.

*> Shot and aim.
01 SHOT-POWER     USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.
01 SHOT-COST      USAGE COMP-2.
01 AFFORDABLE     USAGE COMP-2.
01 FLIGHT         USAGE COMP-2.
01 AIM-OUT        USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 AIM-PITCH-OUT  USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 SCAN-HEADING   USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 SCAN-PITCH     USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 SCAN-ARC       USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 50.
01 SWEEP          USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.

*> Movement: the desired world velocity and the controls that give it.
01 CX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 CY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 CZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 HALF           USAGE COMP-2.
01 TX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 TY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 DX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 DY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 DZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 WANT-SPEED     USAGE COMP-2.
01 SUSTAINABLE    USAGE COMP-2.
01 MARGIN         USAGE COMP-2.
01 OFF-X          USAGE COMP-2.
01 OFF-Y          USAGE COMP-2.
01 OFF-Z          USAGE COMP-2.
01 OFF-R          USAGE COMP-2.
01 SAFE           USAGE COMP-2.
01 PULL           USAGE COMP-2.
01 AX             USAGE COMP-2.
01 AY             USAGE COMP-2.
01 AZ             USAGE COMP-2.
01 THROTTLE       USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 TURN-CONTROL   USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 PITCH-TURN     USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 THRUST         USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 STRAFE         USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 LIFT           USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 YAW-TORQUE     USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 PITCH-TORQUE   USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 ROLL-TORQUE    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 BRAKE          USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 STATUS-VALUE   USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.

*> Scratch for the angle helpers.
01 ANGLE-A        USAGE COMP-2.
01 ANGLE-B        USAGE COMP-2.
01 ANGLE-D        USAGE COMP-2.
01 CLAMP-V        USAGE COMP-2.
01 RAD            USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.0174532925199433.
01 WORK-1         USAGE COMP-2.
01 WORK-2         USAGE COMP-2.
01 ORIGIN-V.
   05 ORIGIN-X    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 ORIGIN-Y    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 ORIGIN-Z    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
01 ANGLE-V.
   05 ANGLE-VX    USAGE COMP-2.
   05 ANGLE-VY    USAGE COMP-2.
   05 ANGLE-VZ    USAGE COMP-2.
01 COOLDOWN-TICKS PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 SHOT-FLAG      PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
01 SHOT-SOLVED    PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 LEAD-POSITION.
   05 LEAD-X USAGE COMP-2.
   05 LEAD-Y USAGE COMP-2.
   05 LEAD-Z USAGE COMP-2.
01 LEAD-VELOCITY.
   05 LEAD-VX USAGE COMP-2.
   05 LEAD-VY USAGE COMP-2.
   05 LEAD-VZ USAGE COMP-2.
01 LIGHT-POWER    USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.5.
01 REVERSE-NEXT   PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOOP.
    PERFORM UNTIL CY-SESSION-EVENT-END
        CALL "CY-READ" USING CY-GAME CY-STATE
        IF RETURN-CODE < 0
            STOP RUN
        END-IF
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN CY-SESSION-EVENT-HELLO
                PERFORM READ-HELLO
                CALL "CY-SEND"
            WHEN CY-SESSION-EVENT-STATE
                PERFORM DECIDE
                CALL "CY-SEND"
        END-EVALUATE
    END-PERFORM
    STOP RUN.

READ-HELLO.
    MOVE CY-MATCH-IS-3D TO MODE-3D
    MOVE 0 TO FORCES GRAVITY-RULE
    IF CY-MATCH-CONTROL-FORCES MOVE 1 TO FORCES END-IF
    IF CY-MATCH-RULESET-GRAVITY-FLAT OR CY-MATCH-RULESET-GRAVITY-HILLS
        MOVE 1 TO GRAVITY-RULE
    END-IF
    MOVE CY-MATCH-MAX-TICKS TO SD-TICK
    CALL "CY-RAW-NUMBER" USING Z"hello.suddenDeath.startTick" SD-TICK
    MOVE CY-ARENA-SIZE-X TO ARENA-W
    MOVE CY-ARENA-SIZE-Y TO ARENA-H
    MOVE CY-ARENA-SIZE-Z TO ARENA-D
    IF MODE-3D = 0 MOVE 0 TO ARENA-D END-IF
    MOVE CY-ARENA-GRAVITY-Z TO GRAVITY-Z
    MOVE CY-BATTERY-CAPACITY TO ENERGY-MAX
    COMPUTE SUSTAINABLE = CY-BATTERY-SUSTAINABLE-DRIVE * 95
    PERFORM CHOOSE-TUNING.

CHOOSE-TUNING.
    MOVE 55 TO SQUARE-HALF
    MOVE 90 TO PATROL-SPEED
    MOVE 140 TO HOLD-TICKS
    MOVE 5 TO SHOTS-PER-STOP
    MOVE 620 TO REACH
    MOVE 1 TO FIRE-RESERVE
    IF CY-MATCH-RULESET-CLASSIC AND MODE-3D = 1
        MOVE 4 TO SHOTS-PER-STOP
        MOVE 140 TO HOLD-TICKS
    END-IF
    IF GRAVITY-RULE = 1
        MOVE 4 TO SHOTS-PER-STOP
    END-IF.

DECIDE.
    PERFORM READ-STATE
    PERFORM NOTE-HITS
    PERFORM OBSERVE
    PERFORM CHOOSE-SCAN
    MOVE 0 TO FIRE-FLAG
    MOVE 0 TO HOLDING
    MOVE 1 TO STATUS-CODE
    IF TRACKING = 1
        PERFORM CHOOSE-POWER
        PERFORM SOLVE-AIM
    END-IF
    PERFORM PATROL
    PERFORM GOVERNOR
    PERFORM STORM-ESCAPE
    PERFORM PILOT
    PERFORM SEND-CONTROLS.

*> Every fact comes from the one read a turn; velocity is real in every
*> ruleset, so the fire gate reads the robot's own speed.
READ-STATE.
    MOVE CY-CLOCK-TICK TO TICK-NUMBER
    MOVE CY-CLOCK-SECONDS TO TIME-NOW
    MOVE CY-ME-POSITION-X TO SX
    MOVE CY-ME-POSITION-Y TO SY
    MOVE CY-ME-POSITION-Z TO SZ
    MOVE CY-ME-HEADING TO SELF-HEADING
    MOVE CY-ME-PITCH TO PITCH
    MOVE CY-GUN-AIM-NOW-HEADING TO AIM-NOW
    MOVE CY-GUN-AIM-NOW-PITCH TO AIM-PITCH-NOW
    MOVE CY-ME-HEALTH TO HEALTH
    MOVE CY-GUN-COOLDOWN-TICKS TO COOLDOWN
    MOVE CY-BATTERY-CHARGE TO ENERGY
    MOVE CY-ME-VELOCITY-X TO MVX
    MOVE CY-ME-VELOCITY-Y TO MVY
    MOVE CY-ME-VELOCITY-Z TO MVZ
    COMPUTE MY-SPEED = FUNCTION SQRT(MVX * MVX + MVY * MVY + MVZ * MVZ)
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-FORWARD-X TO FWD-X
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-FORWARD-Y TO FWD-Y
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-FORWARD-Z TO FWD-Z
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-RIGHT-X TO RGT-X
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-RIGHT-Y TO RGT-Y
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-RIGHT-Z TO RGT-Z
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-UP-X TO UP-X
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-UP-Y TO UP-Y
    MOVE CY-ME-ATTITUDE-UP-Z TO UP-Z
    MOVE CY-ME-ANGULAR-VELOCITY-YAW TO W-YAW
    MOVE CY-ME-ANGULAR-VELOCITY-PITCH TO W-PITCH
    MOVE CY-ME-ANGULAR-VELOCITY-ROLL TO W-ROLL
    MOVE 0 TO TERRAIN
    IF GRAVITY-RULE = 1
        CALL "CY-ARENA-GROUND-HEIGHT" USING SX SY TERRAIN
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO ZONE-PRESENT STORM-PRESENT
    IF CY-NAV-ZONE-FOUND
        MOVE 1 TO ZONE-PRESENT
        MOVE CY-NAV-ZONE-CENTER-X TO ZONE-X
        MOVE CY-NAV-ZONE-CENTER-Y TO ZONE-Y
        MOVE CY-NAV-ZONE-CENTER-Z TO ZONE-Z
        MOVE CY-NAV-ZONE-RADIUS TO ZONE-RADIUS
    END-IF
    IF CY-NAV-STORM-FOUND
        MOVE 1 TO STORM-PRESENT
        MOVE CY-NAV-STORM-CENTER-X TO STORM-X
        MOVE CY-NAV-STORM-CENTER-Y TO STORM-Y
        MOVE CY-NAV-STORM-RADIUS TO STORM-RADIUS
        MOVE CY-NAV-STORM-VELOCITY-X TO STORM-VX
        MOVE CY-NAV-STORM-VELOCITY-Y TO STORM-VY
    END-IF.

*> A drop in health outside sudden death is a hit.
NOTE-HITS.
    MOVE 0 TO WAS-HIT
    IF LAST-HEALTH >= 0 AND HEALTH < LAST-HEALTH - 0.5 AND ZONE-PRESENT = 0
        MOVE 1 TO WAS-HIT
    END-IF
    MOVE HEALTH TO LAST-HEALTH.


*> One track, of the nearest robot the sensors see. The core estimates
*> velocity separately for each slot, including in a crowded field.
OBSERVE.
    MOVE 0 TO VISIBLE
    IF CY-SENSORS-NEAREST-FOUND
        MOVE CY-SENSORS-NEAREST-POSITION-X TO PX
        MOVE CY-SENSORS-NEAREST-POSITION-Y TO PY
        MOVE CY-SENSORS-NEAREST-POSITION-Z TO PZ
        *> The core keeps velocity by robot slot, so changing the nearest
        *> contact cannot mix two opponents into one false motion estimate.
        CALL "CY-TRACKER-VELOCITY" USING CY-SENSORS-NEAREST-SLOT CY-VEC3
        IF RETURN-CODE = 0
            MOVE CY-VEC3-X TO TRACK-VX
            MOVE CY-VEC3-Y TO TRACK-VY
            MOVE CY-VEC3-Z TO TRACK-VZ
        ELSE
            MOVE 0 TO TRACK-VX TRACK-VY TRACK-VZ
        END-IF
        MOVE PX TO TRACK-X
        MOVE PY TO TRACK-Y
        MOVE PZ TO TRACK-Z
        MOVE TIME-NOW TO TRACK-T
        MOVE 1 TO TRACK-VALID VISIBLE
    ELSE
        IF TIME-NOW - TRACK-T > 3
            MOVE 0 TO TRACK-VALID
        END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE TRACK-VALID TO TRACKING
    IF TRACKING = 1
        COMPUTE AGE = TIME-NOW - TRACK-T
        COMPUTE QX = TRACK-X + TRACK-VX * AGE
        COMPUTE QY = TRACK-Y + TRACK-VY * AGE
        COMPUTE QZ = TRACK-Z + TRACK-VZ * AGE
        COMPUTE RX = QX - SX
        COMPUTE RY = QY - SY
        COMPUTE RZ = QZ - SZ
        COMPUTE FLAT = FUNCTION SQRT(RX * RX + RY * RY)
        COMPUTE DIST = FUNCTION SQRT(RX * RX + RY * RY + RZ * RZ)
        IF DIST < 1 MOVE 1 TO DIST END-IF
    END-IF.

*> ANGLE-A and WORK-2 are the heading and the elevation of ANGLE-V.
VECTOR-ANGLES.
    CALL "CY-ANGLES-BEARING-TO" USING ORIGIN-V ANGLE-V ANGLE-A
    CALL "CY-ANGLES-ELEVATION-TO" USING ORIGIN-V ANGLE-V WORK-2.

CHOOSE-SCAN.
    IF TRACKING = 1 AND AGE < 0.6
        MOVE RX TO ANGLE-VX
        MOVE RY TO ANGLE-VY
        MOVE RZ TO ANGLE-VZ
        PERFORM VECTOR-ANGLES
        MOVE ANGLE-A TO SCAN-HEADING
        MOVE 0 TO SCAN-PITCH
        IF MODE-3D = 1 MOVE WORK-2 TO SCAN-PITCH END-IF
        MOVE 30 TO SCAN-ARC
    ELSE
        IF SWEEP-SET = 0
            MOVE SELF-HEADING TO SWEEP
            MOVE 1 TO SWEEP-SET
        END-IF
        COMPUTE SWEEP = FUNCTION MOD(SWEEP + 45, 360)
        MOVE SWEEP TO SCAN-HEADING
        MOVE 50 TO SCAN-ARC
        MOVE 0 TO SCAN-PITCH
        IF MODE-3D = 1
            COMPUTE PITCH-STEP = FUNCTION MOD(TICK-NUMBER / 8, 3)
            COMPUTE SCAN-PITCH = (PITCH-STEP - 1) * 40
        END-IF
    END-IF.

*> The heaviest shot that lands in its flight budget: long at a slow
*> target, shorter at a moving one, light at a crossing one or on a low
*> battery, and never more than the battery pays for.
CHOOSE-POWER.
    COMPUTE TARGET-SPEED = FUNCTION SQRT(TRACK-VX * TRACK-VX + TRACK-VY * TRACK-VY + TRACK-VZ * TRACK-VZ)
    COMPUTE ALONG = (TRACK-VX * RX + TRACK-VY * RY + TRACK-VZ * RZ) / DIST
    COMPUTE AX = TRACK-VX - ALONG * RX / DIST
    COMPUTE AY = TRACK-VY - ALONG * RY / DIST
    COMPUTE AZ = TRACK-VZ - ALONG * RZ / DIST
    COMPUTE CROSSING = FUNCTION SQRT(AX * AX + AY * AY + AZ * AZ)
    IF TARGET-SPEED < 30
        MOVE 2.5 TO FLIGHT
    ELSE
        MOVE 1.2 TO FLIGHT
    END-IF
    CALL "CY-GUN-POWER-FOR-FLIGHT-TIME" USING DIST FLIGHT SHOT-POWER
    IF CROSSING > 60 AND SHOT-POWER > LIGHT-POWER MOVE LIGHT-POWER TO SHOT-POWER END-IF
    IF ENERGY < ENERGY-MAX * 0.3 AND SHOT-POWER > LIGHT-POWER MOVE LIGHT-POWER TO SHOT-POWER END-IF
    IF SHOT-POWER > CY-GUN-MAX-POWER AND CY-GUN-MAX-POWER > 0 MOVE CY-GUN-MAX-POWER TO SHOT-POWER END-IF
    COMPUTE SHOT-POWER = FUNCTION INTEGER(SHOT-POWER * 10 + 0.5) / 10
    CALL "CY-GUN-SHOT-COST" USING SHOT-POWER SHOT-COST.

*> The core solves the shot with muzzle offset, inherited velocity and
*> gravity. An unreachable solution is an aim/search opportunity, not a shot.
SOLVE-AIM.
    MOVE 0 TO SHOT-SOLVED
    MOVE QX TO LEAD-X
    MOVE QY TO LEAD-Y
    MOVE QZ TO LEAD-Z
    MOVE TRACK-VX TO LEAD-VX
    MOVE TRACK-VY TO LEAD-VY
    MOVE TRACK-VZ TO LEAD-VZ
    CALL "CY-GUN-LEAD-POINT" USING LEAD-POSITION LEAD-VELOCITY SHOT-POWER CY-SOLUTION
    IF RETURN-CODE = 0
        MOVE 1 TO SHOT-SOLVED
        MOVE CY-SOLUTION-HEADING TO AIM-OUT
        MOVE CY-SOLUTION-PITCH TO AIM-PITCH-OUT
    ELSE
        MOVE RX TO ANGLE-VX
        MOVE RY TO ANGLE-VY
        MOVE RZ TO ANGLE-VZ
        PERFORM VECTOR-ANGLES
        MOVE ANGLE-A TO AIM-OUT
        MOVE WORK-2 TO AIM-PITCH-OUT
    END-IF
    IF MODE-3D = 0 MOVE 0 TO AIM-PITCH-OUT END-IF.

*> The square patrol: drive to the next corner, stop, fire, move on.
PATROL.
    COMPUTE CX = ARENA-W / 2
    COMPUTE CY = ARENA-H / 2
    COMPUTE CZ = ARENA-D / 2
    MOVE SQUARE-HALF TO HALF
    IF ZONE-PRESENT = 1
        MOVE ZONE-X TO CX
        MOVE ZONE-Y TO CY
        IF GRAVITY-RULE = 0 MOVE ZONE-Z TO CZ END-IF
        IF HALF > ZONE-RADIUS * 0.45 COMPUTE HALF = ZONE-RADIUS * 0.45 END-IF
    END-IF
    EVALUATE CORNER
        WHEN 0 COMPUTE TX = CX + HALF
               COMPUTE TY = CY + HALF
        WHEN 1 COMPUTE TX = CX - HALF
               COMPUTE TY = CY + HALF
        WHEN 2 COMPUTE TX = CX - HALF
               COMPUTE TY = CY - HALF
        WHEN OTHER COMPUTE TX = CX + HALF
               COMPUTE TY = CY - HALF
    END-EVALUATE
    COMPUTE DX = TX - SX
    COMPUTE DY = TY - SY
    IF MODE-3D = 1 AND GRAVITY-RULE = 0
        COMPUTE DZ = CZ - SZ
    ELSE
        MOVE 0 TO DZ
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WORK-1 = FUNCTION SQRT(DX * DX + DY * DY + DZ * DZ)
    IF AT-CORNER = 0 AND WORK-1 < 18
        MOVE 1 TO AT-CORNER
        MOVE TICK-NUMBER TO HOLD-START
        MOVE 0 TO CORNER-SHOTS
    END-IF
    IF AT-CORNER = 1
        *> Hold the corner, and fire from rest.
        COMPUTE DX = DX * 0.5
        COMPUTE DY = DY * 0.5
        COMPUTE DZ = DZ * 0.5
        MOVE 1 TO HOLDING
        MOVE 2 TO STATUS-CODE
        PERFORM FIRE-GATE
        *> Move on after the shots or when the stop runs long. A hit after
        *> the second shot sends the patrol back the way it came once the
        *> stop's shots are done, and a contact closing in sends it to the
        *> corner farthest from it.
        IF WAS-HIT = 1 AND CORNER-SHOTS > 1 MOVE 1 TO REVERSE-NEXT END-IF
        IF TRACKING = 1 AND DIST < CLOSE-RANGE AND COOLDOWN > 0
            PERFORM FARTHEST-CORNER
        ELSE
            IF (CORNER-SHOTS >= SHOTS-PER-STOP AND FIRE-FLAG = 0)
                    OR TICK-NUMBER - HOLD-START > HOLD-TICKS
                    OR (TRACKING = 0 AND TICK-NUMBER - HOLD-START > 15)
                IF REVERSE-NEXT = 1 COMPUTE PATROL-DIR = 0 - PATROL-DIR END-IF
                PERFORM NEXT-CORNER
            END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        *> Drive along the edge, slowing for the corner.
        COMPUTE WANT-SPEED = WORK-1 * 1.5
        IF WANT-SPEED > PATROL-SPEED MOVE PATROL-SPEED TO WANT-SPEED END-IF
        IF WORK-1 < 1 MOVE 1 TO WORK-1 END-IF
        COMPUTE DX = DX / WORK-1 * WANT-SPEED
        COMPUTE DY = DY / WORK-1 * WANT-SPEED
        COMPUTE DZ = DZ / WORK-1 * WANT-SPEED
    END-IF.


NEXT-CORNER.
    COMPUTE CORNER = FUNCTION MOD(CORNER + PATROL-DIR + 4, 4)
    MOVE 0 TO AT-CORNER REVERSE-NEXT.


*> The corner of the square diagonally away from the contact's side.
FARTHEST-CORNER.
    IF QX > CX
        IF QY > CY MOVE 2 TO CORNER ELSE MOVE 1 TO CORNER END-IF
    ELSE
        IF QY > CY MOVE 3 TO CORNER ELSE MOVE 0 TO CORNER END-IF
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO AT-CORNER.


*> Fire only on target, still, ready, in reach and with battery to spare.
FIRE-GATE.
    IF TRACKING = 0 OR SHOT-SOLVED = 0 OR COOLDOWN > 0 OR DIST >= REACH OR MY-SPEED >= 30
            OR ENERGY < SHOT-COST + FIRE-RESERVE OR (VISIBLE = 0 AND AGE >= 0.2)
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE AIM-OUT TO ANGLE-A
    MOVE AIM-NOW TO ANGLE-B
    PERFORM ANGLE-DELTA
    IF FUNCTION ABS(ANGLE-D) >= 3
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF MODE-3D = 1 AND FUNCTION ABS(AIM-PITCH-OUT - AIM-PITCH-NOW) >= 3
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE 1 TO FIRE-FLAG
    MOVE 3 TO STATUS-CODE
    ADD 1 TO CORNER-SHOTS.


*> On a low battery, hold speed to what the regeneration sustains.
GOVERNOR.
    IF ENERGY < ENERGY-MAX * 0.4
        COMPUTE WORK-1 = FUNCTION SQRT(DX * DX + DY * DY + DZ * DZ)
        IF WORK-1 > SUSTAINABLE
            COMPUTE DX = DX * SUSTAINABLE / WORK-1
            COMPUTE DY = DY * SUSTAINABLE / WORK-1
            COMPUTE DZ = DZ * SUSTAINABLE / WORK-1
        END-IF
    END-IF.

*> The storm: step out across its path, on the side away from its centre,
*> then go back to the patrol. Walls and the safe zone in PILOT still win.
STORM-ESCAPE.
    IF STORM-PRESENT = 1
        COMPUTE STORM-AX = SX - STORM-X
        COMPUTE STORM-AY = SY - STORM-Y
        COMPUTE STORM-D = FUNCTION SQRT(STORM-AX * STORM-AX + STORM-AY * STORM-AY)
        IF STORM-D < 1 MOVE 1 TO STORM-D END-IF
        COMPUTE STORM-V = FUNCTION SQRT(STORM-VX * STORM-VX + STORM-VY * STORM-VY)
        COMPUTE MARGIN = STORM-RADIUS + 60 + STORM-V
        IF STORM-D < MARGIN
            IF STORM-V > 1
                COMPUTE STORM-PX = 0 - STORM-VY / STORM-V
                COMPUTE STORM-PY = STORM-VX / STORM-V
            ELSE
                COMPUTE STORM-PX = STORM-AX / STORM-D
                COMPUTE STORM-PY = STORM-AY / STORM-D
            END-IF
            IF STORM-PX * STORM-AX + STORM-PY * STORM-AY < 0
                COMPUTE STORM-PX = 0 - STORM-PX
                COMPUTE STORM-PY = 0 - STORM-PY
            END-IF
            COMPUTE STORM-PX = STORM-PX + 0.5 * STORM-AX / STORM-D
            COMPUTE STORM-PY = STORM-PY + 0.5 * STORM-AY / STORM-D
            COMPUTE WORK-1 = FUNCTION SQRT(STORM-PX * STORM-PX + STORM-PY * STORM-PY)
            IF WORK-1 < 0.01 MOVE 0.01 TO WORK-1 END-IF
            COMPUTE STORM-PUSH = (MARGIN - STORM-D) / 60
            IF STORM-PUSH > 1 MOVE 1 TO STORM-PUSH END-IF
            COMPUTE STORM-PUSH = STORM-PUSH * 95
            COMPUTE DX = DX * 0.3 + STORM-PX / WORK-1 * STORM-PUSH
            COMPUTE DY = DY * 0.3 + STORM-PY / WORK-1 * STORM-PUSH
            MOVE 0 TO HOLDING
        END-IF
    END-IF.


*> Turns the desired world velocity (DX, DY, DZ) into classic or force
*> controls, with wall avoidance, zone homing and a hover height.
PILOT.
    COMPUTE MARGIN = 60 + MVX * MVX / 180
    IF SX < MARGIN AND DX < (MARGIN - SX) * 1.5 COMPUTE DX = (MARGIN - SX) * 1.5 END-IF
    IF SX > ARENA-W - MARGIN AND DX > (ARENA-W - MARGIN - SX) * 1.5 COMPUTE DX = (ARENA-W - MARGIN - SX) * 1.5 END-IF
    COMPUTE MARGIN = 60 + MVY * MVY / 180
    IF SY < MARGIN AND DY < (MARGIN - SY) * 1.5 COMPUTE DY = (MARGIN - SY) * 1.5 END-IF
    IF SY > ARENA-H - MARGIN AND DY > (ARENA-H - MARGIN - SY) * 1.5 COMPUTE DY = (ARENA-H - MARGIN - SY) * 1.5 END-IF
    IF MODE-3D = 1
        COMPUTE MARGIN = 60 + MVZ * MVZ / 180
        IF SZ < MARGIN AND DZ < (MARGIN - SZ) * 1.5 COMPUTE DZ = (MARGIN - SZ) * 1.5 END-IF
        IF SZ > ARENA-D - MARGIN AND DZ > (ARENA-D - MARGIN - SZ) * 1.5 COMPUTE DZ = (ARENA-D - MARGIN - SZ) * 1.5 END-IF
    END-IF
    *> Head for the zone a few seconds before it appears, then stay inside.
    IF ZONE-PRESENT = 1
        COMPUTE OFF-X = SX - ZONE-X
        COMPUTE OFF-Y = SY - ZONE-Y
        COMPUTE OFF-Z = SZ - ZONE-Z
        COMPUTE SAFE = ZONE-RADIUS - 35
        IF SAFE < 40 MOVE 40 TO SAFE END-IF
    ELSE
        COMPUTE OFF-X = SX - ARENA-W / 2
        COMPUTE OFF-Y = SY - ARENA-H / 2
        COMPUTE OFF-Z = SZ - ARENA-D / 2
        IF TICK-NUMBER < SD-TICK - 100
            MOVE 100000 TO SAFE
        ELSE
            MOVE 280 TO SAFE
        END-IF
    END-IF
    IF MODE-3D = 0 OR GRAVITY-RULE = 1 MOVE 0 TO OFF-Z END-IF
    COMPUTE OFF-R = FUNCTION SQRT(OFF-X * OFF-X + OFF-Y * OFF-Y + OFF-Z * OFF-Z)
    IF OFF-R > SAFE
        COMPUTE PULL = 25 + OFF-R - SAFE
        IF PULL > 95 MOVE 95 TO PULL END-IF
        COMPUTE DX = 0 - OFF-X / OFF-R * PULL
        COMPUTE DY = 0 - OFF-Y / OFF-R * PULL
        COMPUTE DZ = 0 - OFF-Z / OFF-R * PULL
        MOVE 0 TO HOLDING
        MOVE 4 TO STATUS-CODE
    END-IF
    IF GRAVITY-RULE = 1
        COMPUTE DZ = (TERRAIN + 115 - SZ) * 1.2
        IF DZ > 35 MOVE 35 TO DZ END-IF
        IF DZ < -35 MOVE -35 TO DZ END-IF
    END-IF
    IF MODE-3D = 0 MOVE 0 TO DZ END-IF
    IF FORCES = 0
        PERFORM PILOT-CLASSIC
    ELSE
        PERFORM PILOT-FORCES
    END-IF.


PILOT-CLASSIC.
    COMPUTE WANT-SPEED = FUNCTION SQRT(DX * DX + DY * DY + DZ * DZ)
    MOVE DX TO ANGLE-VX
    MOVE DY TO ANGLE-VY
    MOVE DZ TO ANGLE-VZ
    PERFORM VECTOR-ANGLES
    MOVE SELF-HEADING TO ANGLE-B
    PERFORM ANGLE-DELTA
    COMPUTE THROTTLE = WANT-SPEED / 95
    IF THROTTLE > 1 MOVE 1 TO THROTTLE END-IF
    *> Reverse rather than turn around when the goal is behind.
    IF FUNCTION ABS(ANGLE-D) > 100
        COMPUTE ANGLE-A = ANGLE-A + 180
        PERFORM ANGLE-DELTA
        COMPUTE THROTTLE = 0 - THROTTLE
    END-IF
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = ANGLE-D / 15
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO TURN-CONTROL
    COMPUTE WORK-1 = FUNCTION ABS(ANGLE-D)
    IF WORK-1 > 80 MOVE 80 TO WORK-1 END-IF
    COMPUTE THROTTLE = THROTTLE * FUNCTION COS(WORK-1 * RAD)
    IF WANT-SPEED < 4 MOVE 0 TO THROTTLE END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO PITCH-TURN
    IF MODE-3D = 1
        IF THROTTLE < 0 COMPUTE WORK-2 = 0 - WORK-2 END-IF
        COMPUTE CLAMP-V = (WORK-2 - PITCH) / 10
        PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
        MOVE CLAMP-V TO PITCH-TURN
    END-IF.


PILOT-FORCES.
    COMPUTE AX = (DX - MVX) * 2
    COMPUTE AY = (DY - MVY) * 2
    COMPUTE AZ = (DZ - MVZ) * 2 - GRAVITY-Z
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = (AX * FWD-X + AY * FWD-Y + AZ * FWD-Z) / 100
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO THRUST
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = (AX * RGT-X + AY * RGT-Y + AZ * RGT-Z) / 100
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO STRAFE
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = (AX * UP-X + AY * UP-Y + AZ * UP-Z) / 100
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO LIFT
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = 0 - W-YAW / 60
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO YAW-TORQUE
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = 0 - W-PITCH / 60
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO PITCH-TORQUE
    COMPUTE CLAMP-V = 0 - W-ROLL / 60
    PERFORM CLAMP-UNIT
    MOVE CLAMP-V TO ROLL-TORQUE
    *> Braking is free, and a robot at rest shoots most precisely.
    MOVE 0 TO BRAKE
    IF HOLDING = 1 MOVE 0.6 TO BRAKE END-IF
    IF MODE-3D = 0
        MOVE 0 TO LIFT PITCH-TORQUE ROLL-TORQUE
    END-IF.


SEND-CONTROLS.
    IF FORCES = 0
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-THROTTLE" USING THROTTLE
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-TURN" USING TURN-CONTROL
        IF MODE-3D = 1 CALL "CY-DRIVE-PITCH-TURN" USING PITCH-TURN END-IF
    ELSE
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-THRUST" USING THRUST
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-STRAFE" USING STRAFE
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-LIFT" USING LIFT
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-YAW-TORQUE" USING YAW-TORQUE
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-PITCH-TORQUE" USING PITCH-TORQUE
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-ROLL-TORQUE" USING ROLL-TORQUE
        CALL "CY-DRIVE-BRAKE" USING BRAKE
    END-IF
    IF TRACKING = 1
        CALL "CY-GUN-AIM-HEADING" USING AIM-OUT
        CALL "CY-GUN-AIM-PITCH" USING AIM-PITCH-OUT
    END-IF
    CALL "CY-SCANNER-HEADING" USING SCAN-HEADING
    CALL "CY-SCANNER-PITCH" USING SCAN-PITCH
    CALL "CY-SCANNER-ARC" USING SCAN-ARC
    IF FIRE-FLAG = 1
        CALL "CY-GUN-POWER" USING SHOT-POWER
        CALL "CY-GUN-FIRE"
    END-IF
    EVALUATE STATUS-CODE
        WHEN 2 CALL "CY-STATUS-TEXT" USING Z"CORNER"
        WHEN 3 CALL "CY-STATUS-TEXT" USING Z"FIRE"
        WHEN 4 CALL "CY-STATUS-TEXT" USING Z"ZONE"
        WHEN OTHER CALL "CY-STATUS-TEXT" USING Z"PATROL"
    END-EVALUATE
    CALL "CY-STATUS-VALUE" USING ENERGY.

*> ANGLE-D is the signed difference ANGLE-A - ANGLE-B, in -180..180.
ANGLE-DELTA.
    COMPUTE ANGLE-D = FUNCTION MOD(ANGLE-A - ANGLE-B + 720 + 180, 360) - 180.


CLAMP-UNIT.
    IF CLAMP-V > 1 MOVE 1 TO CLAMP-V END-IF
    IF CLAMP-V < -1 MOVE -1 TO CLAMP-V END-IF.
